nodes 8
tiers 2
podsize 8
# Simple 2-Tier Leaf-Spine Topology with 8 hosts for timing comparison

# Tier 0: ToR switches  
tier 0
downlink_speed_gbps 10
radix_up 2
radix_down 4
switch_latency_ns 100
downlink_latency_ns 1000
oversubscribed 2
# 2 ToRs, each connects to 4 hosts and has 2 uplinks to aggregation

# Tier 1: Aggregation switches
tier 1
downlink_speed_gbps 10
radix_down 2
switch_latency_ns 100  
downlink_latency_ns 1000
# 1 agg switch with 2 downlinks to the ToRs